@startuml
title DFD To-Be 02 — Медкарты и лаборатория
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Врач / Пациент" as U
cloud "Лаборатория\nвнешняя" as L
rectangle "Gateway\nOIDC, TLS" as G
rectangle "Medical Service\nABAC per patient\ncare relationship" as S
rectangle "Lab Adapter\nmTLS, schema validation\nminimized payload" as I
database "Clinical DB + private files\nKMS, encrypted, L3 tags" as D
database "Audit / SIEM\nimmutable access log" as A
U --> G : запрос документов
G --> S : identity, scope
S <--> D : authorized read/write
S <--> I : signed request/result
I <--> L : mTLS, scoped data
S --> A : actor, patient, purpose, outcome
I --> A : exchange metadata
note bottom of S
  Пациент читает только свои документы.
  Врач — только при назначении и цели лечения.
end note
@enduml
